1
00:00:05,908 --> 00:00:07,908
[MOVIE PLAYING OVER TV]

2
00:00:19,964 --> 00:00:21,254
[OBJECT WHOOSHES OVER TV]

3
00:00:22,842 --> 00:00:26,512
Did it look like that spear was gonna
go right through your skull?

4
00:00:26,679 --> 00:00:27,759
(Raj:)No.

5
00:00:29,723 --> 00:00:33,523
(Leonard:)Hey, you didn't want a Slurpee
at 7-Eleven, you don't get glasses.

6
00:00:34,353 --> 00:00:35,603
[PHONE RINGS]

7
00:00:35,771 --> 00:00:38,771
(Sheldon(phone rings):)Oh. That will be another
congratulatory call for me.

8
00:00:39,733 --> 00:00:42,863
(Sheldon(phone rings):)-Mute, please.
-Wait. Hang on. Flaming arrow.

9
00:00:43,028 --> 00:00:44,278
[ARROW WHOOSHES OVER TV]

10
00:00:46,407 --> 00:00:47,577
(Sheldon:)Hello?

11
00:00:47,741 --> 00:00:50,241
(Sheldon:)Oh, Chancellor Morton,
how are you, sir?

12
00:00:52,454 --> 00:00:55,744
(Sheldon:)Yes, I was expecting your call.
Three years ago.

13
00:00:57,293 --> 00:00:58,753
(Sheldon:)I see.

14
00:00:58,919 --> 00:01:02,019
(Sheldon:)What happens if
I choose not to give a speech?

